### FEATURE_AI_ASSIST — what a model makes of work the deterministic rules do not catch.
###
### **Read this section before demonstrating it.** The one honest claim this feature makes is narrow:
### `ProcessShapeHeuristic` catches long checklists and handover language, and a test asserts that it
### returns **nothing** for *Onboarding client nou: strânge brieful, trimite contractul, programează
### kickoff-ul* — four handovers between three people, and a process by any reading. Decision row 374
### records that miss deliberately. This is the one place in the product where the rules run out.
###
### It is **off by default**. `FLOWOPS_AI_ENABLED=true` and `docker compose up -d ollama`.

@host = http://localhost:8081
@templateId = REPLACE-WITH-AN-APPROVED-TEMPLATE-id

### Sign in first — see auth.http for why the token dance is required.

### ── The case the rules miss ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
###
### On the seeded demo this is *Onboarding client nou*, whose `processShapeHints` from
### `GET /task-templates` is an **empty array**. Ask the model about the same template and it answers
### `suggested: true` with four steps.
###
### **Check three things in the body, because each is a guarantee rather than a nicety:**
###
### 1. Every `text` is in **Romanian** — the words somebody typed. The model answers with *keys*
###    (`c1`, `c2`) and the server looks the words up. An early version asked it to title the steps
###    and it returned *Client brief* and *Contract signing*: fluent, plausible, nobody's words.
###
### 2. There is **no rationale field at all**. The model writes one sentence to think in and the
###    product throws it away — one sampled run produced *Strângeleaza clientul*, which is not a
###    Romanian word. So no model-authored text reaches a screen, and `evidenceLines` is the only
###    number, counted by the server from rows it holds.
###
### 3. `partial` says whether some of the answer was dropped as untraceable, or the template was
###    longer than the forty-line evidence bound. A screen must not imply it saw the whole picture.
###
### The first call takes about eighteen seconds. The second is instant — ten-minute cache, misses
### included, because *there is nothing to suggest* is the common answer and re-discovering it costs
### the same eighteen seconds.
GET {{host}}/api/ai-assist/template-shape/{{templateId}}

### The same template again. Sub-second, identical body.
GET {{host}}/api/ai-assist/template-shape/{{templateId}}

### ── Where it is wrong, which is the part to rehearse ─────────────────────────────────────────────
###
### Try it on *Raport săptămânal de vânzări* — export the figures, compare with last week. That is one
### person's work and the model says **process about half the time**. Measured on the seeded demo, six
### runs at temperature 0.1.
###
### That is why the card asks *Does this change hands?* rather than announcing an answer, and why it
### carries a sentence saying the product is not sure. **Do not demonstrate this as a classifier.** It
### is a prompt to look, on the one case the rules cannot reach, and it writes nothing either way.
GET {{host}}/api/ai-assist/template-shape/REPLACE-WITH-A-SIMPLE-TEMPLATE-id

### ── Switched off ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
###
### Restart without `FLOWOPS_AI_ENABLED=true` and run the first request again. **200 with
### `available: false`**, not a 404 and not a 503: `CONSTRAINT-AI-OPTIONAL-01` makes a model-less
### product a supported configuration rather than a fault. The card renders nothing at all, and every
### other figure on the template page is exactly as it was — none of them ever came from a model.
###
### Worth doing once before the walkthrough: it is the configuration the thesis defends, and the
### switched-off product contains no code that can reach Ollama.
GET {{host}}/api/ai-assist/template-shape/{{templateId}}

### 403 for a caller without TASK_TEMPLATE_VIEW. The permission is the one for the thing being
### reasoned about rather than a permission of its own — an opinion is a derived reading of the same
### words, and a separate permission would be a route to the content through the commentary.
GET {{host}}/api/ai-assist/template-shape/{{templateId}}
